# Normalize text files to LF in the repo; shell scripts and the Makefile must stay LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.parquet binary
*.duckdb binary
*.png binary
# Rendered diagrams: keep the bytes D2 writes (no EOL conversion, so make diagrams-check compares
# exactly what CI renders) and collapse them in PR diffs; review the .d2 source instead.
*.svg -text
docs/diagrams/*.svg linguist-generated=true
